From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FoAKTEE <hw609@cantab.ac.uk>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:43:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/24] feat(m7-coeffs): port the BlackLightPlus thermal
 coefficients as EMIS_BLP

- change: src/blp_coeffs.c ports thermal_synchrotron_polarized (M21 j_I/j_Q/j_V, Kirchhoff with expm1, rho_Q/rho_V with A&S Bessels, theta_e < 0.01 ramps) operation by operation, in invariant form
- change: Q-type coefficients (j_Q, alpha_Q, rho_Q) change sign into RAPTOR's e_1-perpendicular-to-B basis; the alpha_P > alpha_I rescale of the BlackLightPlus segment is applied in evaluate_coeffs_blp
- change: evaluate_coeffs_single dispatches to evaluate_coeffs_blp when EMIS_BLP (default 0 in functions.h, 1 in model/blp_analytic); run/makefile compiles blp_coeffs.c
- result: R03 table (40959 cells) max relative difference to BlackLightPlus 2.3e-13 (j), 1.1e-13 (alpha), 6.2e-14 (rho_Q), 1.5e-14 (rho_V); no sign or zero mismatches [SOLID]
- verify: tests/coeff_table + BlackLightPlus results/blp/raptor/tools/r03_verify.sh
